# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Administrator-issued token:** The role mints a Gitea personal access token named ``gitea-mcp`` for the ``administrator`` account with the read-only scope set ``read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification``, and persists it in the token store MCP clients read. Every deploy asks the API whether the stored token still authenticates, revokes the stale entry under that name, and re-mints when the API rejects it. The deploy fails if the fresh token is rejected too."
msgstr "**Administrator 조직 토큰:** 역할 mints a Gitea 개인 액세스 토큰 ``gitea-mcp`` 제품정보 ``administrator`` read-only 범위 설정 계정 ``read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification``, 토큰 저장소 MCP 클라이언트에서 그것을 persists. 모든 배포 요청 API 저장 된 토큰이 여전히 정통 여부, 그 이름 아래 stale 엔트리를 수정하고, 재 분은 API 그것을 거부합니다. 배포는 신선한 토큰이 거부되면 실패합니다."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Administrator-issued token:** The role mints a Gitea personal access token named `gitea-mcp` for the `administrator` account with the read-only scope set `read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification`, and persists it in the token store MCP clients read. Every deploy asks the API whether the stored token still authenticates, revokes the stale entry under that name, and re-mints when the API rejects it. The deploy fails if the fresh token is rejected too."
msgstr "**Administrator 조직 토큰:** 역할 mints a Gitea 개인 액세스 토큰 `gitea-mcp` 제품정보 `administrator` read-only 범위 설정 계정 `read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification`, 토큰 저장소 MCP 클라이언트에서 그것을 persists. 모든 배포 요청 API 저장 된 토큰이 여전히 정통 여부, 그 이름 아래 stale 엔트리를 수정하고, 재 분은 API 그것을 거부합니다. 배포는 신선한 토큰이 거부되면 실패합니다."

msgid "**Administrator:** blocked only with ``sso`` off. The shared native login looks the username field up by the names ``username``, ``email`` and ``login``, while Matomo names it ``form_login``, so the persona would submit the password alone. ``files/playwright/auth.spec.js`` drives the native form of the local superuser. With ``sso`` on the persona clicks the RebelOIDC button and signs in through Keycloak; ``files/playwright/addons/rebeloidc.spec.js`` additionally asserts the superuser access and the Keycloak sign-out."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrator:** blocked only with `sso` off. The shared native login looks the username field up by the names `username`, `email` and `login`, while Matomo names it `form_login`, so the persona would submit the password alone. `files/playwright/auth.spec.js` drives the native form of the local superuser. With `sso` on the persona clicks the RebelOIDC button and signs in through Keycloak; `files/playwright/addons/rebeloidc.spec.js` additionally asserts the superuser access and the Keycloak sign-out."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrators and domain managers:** [files/python/rbac_sync.py](./files/python/rbac_sync.py) sets `global_admin` from the `web-app-mailu` `administrator` members and the managers of the mail domain from the `domain-manager` members through the Mailu REST API inside the admin container. Members are promoted, every other global administrator and domain manager is demoted. The platform administrator stays a global administrator. It runs as a host hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrators and domain managers:** `files/python/rbac_sync.py <./files/python/rbac_sync.py>`__ sets ``global_admin`` from the ``web-app-mailu`` ``administrator`` members and the managers of the mail domain from the ``domain-manager`` members through the Mailu REST API inside the admin container. Members are promoted, every other global administrator and domain manager is demoted. The platform administrator stays a global administrator. It runs as a host hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrators:** System Administrator follows the ``web-app-stalwart`` ``administrator`` members. `files/python/rbac_sync.py <./files/python/rbac_sync.py>`__ grants and revokes it through the management JMAP API as a host hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__, at every SSO deploy and on its timer, so a member who signs in for the first time gets it on the next run. The recovery administrator ``stalwartadmin`` and the platform administrator keep it."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Administrators:** System Administrator follows the `web-app-stalwart` `administrator` members. [files/python/rbac_sync.py](./files/python/rbac_sync.py) grants and revokes it through the management JMAP API as a host hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/), at every SSO deploy and on its timer, so a member who signs in for the first time gets it on the next run. The recovery administrator `stalwartadmin` and the platform administrator keep it."
msgstr ""

