msgid "**Bounded caches**: fixed caps, age eviction, `make cache-evict`, `make cache-status`, the disk floor, the migration and the host build cache cap. This alone removes the disk risk."
msgstr ""

# * ``step`` 그것의 점 조사는에 대하여 검사했습니다 ``result_items`` 그리고 맞는 가장 작은 단계로 거부됩니다,
# 그래서 업스트림은 어댑터가 discard 할 수있는 범위를 결코 검사하지 않습니다.
# ``start``, ``end`` and ``step`` has its point count checked against
# ``result_items`` and is refused with the smallest step that fits, so the
# upstream never scans a range whose result the adapter would discard.
