# 이미지 배 `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`· 1595 깊은, 나르는
# `max_input_tokens`· `supports_vision`· `supports_function_calling` 이름 *
# `input_cost_per_token`. 걸이는 노선의 기능을에서 읽습니다 `litellm.model_cost`, 경로의 자신의 열쇠
# `litellm_params.model` 그리고 그 이름에 그것의 첫번째 세그먼트 없이, 때문에 `ollama/llama3` 파일 접두사
# `openai/gpt-4o-mini` 파일 형식 `gpt-4o-mini`. 그것은 결코 요구 시간에 backend를 조사하지 않습니다.
# declaration is the override.** The image ships
# `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`, 1595 models deep, carrying
# `max_input_tokens`, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling` and
# `input_cost_per_token`. The hook reads a route's capabilities from
# `litellm.model_cost`, keyed on the route's own `litellm_params.model` and
# then on that name without its first segment, because `ollama/llama3` is
# filed prefixed while `openai/gpt-4o-mini` is filed as `gpt-4o-mini`. It
# never probes a backend at request time.
msgid "**Eligibility is read from LiteLLM's own catalog; a declaration is the override.** The image ships `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`, 1595 models deep, carrying `max_input_tokens`, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling` and `input_cost_per_token`. The hook reads a route's capabilities from `litellm.model_cost`, keyed on the route's own `litellm_params.model` and then on that name without its first segment, because `ollama/llama3` is filed prefixed while `openai/gpt-4o-mini` is filed as `gpt-4o-mini`. It never probes a backend at request time."
msgstr ""

