msgid "**Engine choice that learns:** with [`svc-ai-s1`](../svc-ai-s1/) deployed the router asks the decider which engine should answer, states each engine's record in the criteria, and after a configured number of comparisons routes straight to the leader. A settled request is still compared again now and then, so a verdict the engines have outgrown does not hold for good: `resample_interval` is read under the same `sample_trigger` as `sample_interval`, so it means every Nth settled request (`requests`, counted across all settled signatures together, not per signature), a one in N chance per settled request (`probability`), or at most one comparison every N seconds (`seconds`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Engine choice that learns:** with ```svc-ai-s1`` <../svc-ai-s1/>`__ deployed the router asks the decider which engine should answer, states each engine’s record in the criteria, and after a configured number of comparisons routes straight to the leader. A settled request is still compared again now and then, so a verdict the engines have outgrown does not hold for good: ``resample_interval`` is read under the same ``sample_trigger`` as ``sample_interval``, so it means every Nth settled request (``requests``, counted across all settled signatures together, not per signature), a one in N chance per settled request (``probability``), or at most one comparison every N seconds (``seconds``)."
msgstr ""

