msgstr "**기타 제품 PostgreSQL 데이터베이스:** 구성 Pretix 중앙화하기 PostgreSQL 서비스."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External database:** Persist Joomla content in the project's central RDBMS through the standard role-meta wiring."
msgstr "**외부 데이터베이스:** 채용정보 Joomla 프로젝트의 중앙 RDBMS에서 표준 역할 메타 배선을 통해 콘텐츠."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External database:** Persist Joomla content in the project’s central RDBMS through the standard role-meta wiring."
msgstr "**외부 데이터베이스:** 채용정보 Joomla 프로젝트의 중앙 RDBMS에서 표준 역할 메타 배선을 통해 콘텐츠."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**External deps:** an AT Protocol PDS (read/write of calendar records), the AT Protocol relay/firehose for aggregation, and optionally Meilisearch."
msgstr "**외부 deps:** AT 프로토콜 PDS (달력 기록의 읽기/쓰기), 통합을 위한 AT 의정서 릴레이/firehose, 그리고 선택적으로 Meilisearch."

msgid "**External drift monitoring.** Addon freshness is checked by opt-in external tests under `tests/external/update/addons/`. These tests are warn-only, emit GitHub Actions warning annotations, and run through `make test-external`, which `make test` runs alongside the other suites, in the same way as Docker image and repository-ref external update checks."
msgstr ""

