msgid "**Native OIDC:** Grafana signs in through Keycloak with ``auth.generic_oauth`` and auto-login. The role mapping reads the ``RBAC.GROUP.CLAIM`` claim: the ``administrator`` role group maps to the Admin role, the ``auditor`` role group of ``meta/rbac.yml`` maps to Viewer, and with ``role_attribute_strict`` every other account is refused. The RBAC sync grants and revokes both groups like every other role group; Grafana re-evaluates the role at each login."
msgstr ""

