msgid "**Role-Based Sign-In:** Only members of a role group of ```meta/rbac.yml`` <./meta/rbac.yml>`__ sign in, through Keycloak (groups claim) and through the directory (``memberOf``) alike: ``administrator`` grants Settings, ``manager`` the Sales, Accounting, Inventory and Project administrator rights, ``user`` the internal user, ``portal`` the customer portal only (``ODOO_RBAC_ROLE_GROUPS`` in ```vars/main.yml`` <./vars/main.yml>`__). Every sign-in replaces these managed groups with the ones the roles grant; the platform administrator is never changed or refused. The addons ```infinito_rbac`` <./files/addons/infinito_rbac/__manifest__.py>`__, ```auth_oauth_https`` <./files/addons/auth_oauth_https/__manifest__.py>`__ and ```auth_ldap_profile`` <./files/addons/auth_ldap_profile/__manifest__.py>`__ under ``files/addons/`` carry the mapping."
