msgid "**Same-origin path:** Every front-proxy vhost also serves the CDN tree under `/_infinito/cdn/`; `lookup('cdn', ...)` and `lookup('design', ...)` return those host-relative URLs as `relative_urls`, so a page served on any network loads its assets from its own host."
