# ([사이트맵](https://spec.torproject.org/address-spec)· [사이트맵 7686
# ·2](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7686.html))
# `Host:` ([ ](https://spec.torproject.org/address-spec),
# [76862](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7686.html)) --- **Subdomains:**
# `sub.<addr>.onion` routes to the ** ** `Host:` ([
