# 강직합니다. 덮개 포탄 반복 (`for`·`while`·`until`), 크로스포 `git -C *`·
# force-push/reset/clean/amend· `rm -rf*`· `sudo*`, 특권 `gh` 한국어
# (`secret`·`ssh-key`·`gpg-key`·`variable`·`extension`·`workflow
# enable`·`workflow disable`·`repo delete`·`pr merge`·`issue transfer`), 그리고
# mutating `gh api` 한국어 (`DELETE`·`PUT`· secrets/keys/collaborators/merge 계정
# 정보)·.
# shapes are blocked outright, even when sandboxed. Covers shell loops
# (`for`/`while`/`until`), cross-repo `git -C *`,
# force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, privileged `gh` verbs
# (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow
# enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), and
# mutating `gh api` verbs (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge
# paths ).
msgid "**`deny`** (precedence 1): structurally destructive shapes are blocked outright, even when sandboxed. Covers shell loops (`for`/`while`/`until`), cross-repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, privileged `gh` verbs (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), and mutating `gh api` verbs (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge paths)."
msgstr ""

