msgid "All three booleans MUST be `true`, and `verified_version` MUST name the exact tag or digest the source was read at. A newer upstream release is not evidence for the deployed pin."
msgstr "모든 세 불린 MUST는 `true`· `verified_version` MUST 이름 정확한 꼬리표 또는 digest 근원은 읽었습니다. 새로운 업스트림 릴리스는 배포 된 핀에 대한 증거가 없습니다."

msgid "All three modules ship with the OpenProject image, and ``tasks/05_addons.yml`` runs the hook of every addon whose gate resolves true."
