# 보다는 오히려, 그래서 그것의 native-OIDC 지원은 사용될 수 없습니다. 대신 auth 프록시에서 문질러, OpenClaw 이름
# * Flowise, 역할의 인정 `administrator` 이름 * `mcp` 그룹. 회사연혁 `API_SERVER_KEY` 혼자 전체
# 경계 전에, 모든 MCP 공급자 헤르메스를 넣어 한 공유 배포 비밀 뒤에 인정. 프록시의 비용은 deliberate입니다.
# openAI-compatible 클라이언트는 더 이상 공개 vhost를 통해 Hermes에 도달하지 않고 컨테이너 네트워크 내부에서 온
# 것입니다.
# version serves a bearer `mcp` rather than a browser dashboard, so its
# native-OIDC support cannot be used. It is gated at the auth proxy instead,
# like Flowise and `administrator`, admitting the role's API and OpenClaw
# groups. Holding `API_SERVER_KEY` alone was the whole boundary before, which
# put every MCP provider Hermes is admitted to behind one shared deployment
# secret. The cost of the proxy is deliberate: an OpenAI-compatible client
# presenting only a bearer no longer reaches Hermes through its public vhost,
# and has to come from inside the container network.
msgid "Amended after implementation: the deployed Hermes version serves a bearer API rather than a browser dashboard, so its native-OIDC support cannot be used. It is gated at the auth proxy instead, like OpenClaw and Flowise, admitting the role's `administrator` and `mcp` groups. Holding `API_SERVER_KEY` alone was the whole boundary before, which put every MCP provider Hermes is admitted to behind one shared deployment secret. The cost of the proxy is deliberate: an OpenAI-compatible client presenting only a bearer no longer reaches Hermes through its public vhost, and has to come from inside the container network."
msgstr ""

# `svc-swarm-manager`·1 범위: 정확하게 1 주인. 노동자는 파생됩니다 `svc-swarm-node −
# svc-swarm-manager` - 중복 목록 없음 `group_vars`·.
# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Among the hosts in `svc-swarm-node`, the cluster manager is identified by additional membership in `svc-swarm-manager`. v1 scope: exactly ONE host. Workers are derived as `svc-swarm-node − svc-swarm-manager` — no duplicated list in `group_vars`."
