# inherit` 통과되지 않고, 그것은 per-job와 GHCR에 정통 `GITHUB_TOKEN` 단지, 그래서 악성 포크는 저장소 /
# 조직 비밀을 읽을 수 없습니다. (더 보기 `pull_request_target` 토큰은 여전히 운반 `packages: write`,
# 그래서 `🛡️ Trusted` 라벨은 이미지 출판을 넘어 모든 것에 대한 실제 신뢰 경계를 유지한다.)
# privileged `pull_request_target` build checks out the **base merge ref**
# (`refs/pull/<N>/merge`) from the base repository: the PR's changes merged
# onto base, with all workflow and build-orchestration scripts coming from
# base, never from the fork. Because `actions/checkout` otherwise refuses to
# fetch a PR ref under `pull_request_target`, the source checkout sets
# `allow-unsafe-pr-checkout: true`. The untrusted build runs **without
# organization secrets** — `secrets: inherit` is not passed and it
# authenticates to GHCR with the per-job `GITHUB_TOKEN` only, so a malicious
# fork cannot read repository/organization secrets. (The `pull_request_target`
# token still carries `packages: write`, so the `🛡️ Trusted` label remains the
# real trust boundary for anything beyond image publication.)
msgid "By default — for an **untrusted** fork PR — the privileged `pull_request_target` build checks out the **base merge ref** (`refs/pull/<N>/merge`) from the base repository: the PR's changes merged onto base, with all workflow and build-orchestration scripts coming from base, never from the fork. Because `actions/checkout` otherwise refuses to fetch a PR ref under `pull_request_target`, the source checkout sets `allow-unsafe-pr-checkout: true`. The untrusted build runs **without organization secrets** — `secrets: inherit` is not passed and it authenticates to GHCR with the per-job `GITHUB_TOKEN` only, so a malicious fork cannot read repository/organization secrets. (The `pull_request_target` token still carries `packages: write`, so the `🛡️ Trusted` label remains the real trust boundary for anything beyond image publication.)"
msgstr ""

