# prometheus를 위해, 감적은 입니다 `prometheus_build_info` 또는
# `<title>Prometheus</title>`. matomo를 위해, 마커는 matomo의 로그인 모양 마커입니다 또는 `piwik`
# 이름 * `matomo` 몸에 문자열. 이름 * 200 non-matching body가 잘못 설정된 프록시 또는 denial-as-로
# 처리됩니다.200 표면과 크게 실패. deny-checks는 공급자의 자신의 spec에서 살고 있습니다
# (`web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` 이름 *
# `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`)·.
# body, not only the status code. A `200 OK` is acceptable ONLY when the body
# contains provider-specific markers proving the response is the genuine
# provider surface. For prometheus, the markers are `prometheus_build_info` or
# `<title>Prometheus</title>`. For matomo, the markers are matomo's login-form
# markers or `piwik` and `matomo` strings in the body. Any 200 with a
# non-matching body is treated as a misconfigured proxy or a denial-as200
# surface and fails loudly. The deny-checks live in the provider's own spec
# (`web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` and
# `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`).
msgid "Direct-probe deny-checks MUST validate the response body, not only the status code. A `200 OK` is acceptable ONLY when the body contains provider-specific markers proving the response is the genuine provider surface. For prometheus, the markers are `prometheus_build_info` or `<title>Prometheus</title>`. For matomo, the markers are matomo's login-form markers or `piwik` and `matomo` strings in the body. Any 200 with a non-matching body is treated as a misconfigured proxy or a denial-as-200 surface and fails loudly. The deny-checks live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` and `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`)."
