# `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. 역할 유지 `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}:
# true` (그래서 역할 기반 계약은 만족) 그러나 `roles_with_service('matomo')` 그것을 떨어뜨리고
# `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` 그리고 모모 트래커 e2e 계약. 정적 파일 (자동 색인) 이름 *
# 301-redirect vhosts 사용자가 HTML 페이지를 실행하지 않는 `_paq` 추적기. 마커 accompanies
# `track:` data flag the lookup 명예.
# `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps
# `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` ( so the role-wiring contract stays
# satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from
# `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for
# static-file ( autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing
# HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data
# flag the lookup honors.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for static-file (autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('prometheus')` drops it from `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserved for 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve a request through lua-resty-prometheus, so they emit no `app=\"<role>\"` label and have no scrape target. The marker accompanies the `scrape:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "자료실 `services.prometheus.scrape: false` 옵션 정보 `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. 역할 유지 `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (그래서 역할 기반 계약은 만족) 그러나 `roles_with_service('prometheus')` 그것을 떨어뜨리고 `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`· 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve the request through lua-resty-prometheus, 그래서 그들은 아니 방출 `app=\"<role>\"` 라벨과 스크랩 대상이 없습니다. 마커 accompanies `scrape:` data flag the lookup 명예."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Documents an `unsafe-*: true` flag in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same line naming what breaks without the relaxation. `unsafe-inline` re-admits the inline execution an XSS needs and `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, so the flag has to be verified against the running app, not copied from another role."
msgstr "자료실 `unsafe-*: true` 기본 정보 `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST는 쌍이 됩니다 `Reason:` 이완없이 휴식하는 것과 같은 선에. `unsafe-inline` 인라인 실행 XSS 필요 및 `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, 그래서 플래그는 실행 응용 프로그램에 대해 확인해야, 다른 역할에서 복사."

