# 잘못 / 빈 `com.docker.compose.network` 이름 * (matrix-deploy 둥근 사이 전형적인). 네트워크가
# 아직도 활동적인 콘테이너 endpoints가 있을 때 제거를 건너, 그래서 공유 서비스 네트워크 (svc-db-mariadb·
# svc-db-postgres, ...) 공급자 콘테이너가 위로 있는 동안 장소에 체재하십시오. 글로벌 `docker network
# prune -f` 그 이름은 관현관이 한 번 실행되지 않는 orphans를 잡아 [apps.sh](../apps.sh) 법인 반복 후에.
# 관련 기사.
# `compose.sh` left it behind with the wrong `com.docker.compose.network`
# label (typical between matrix-deploy rounds). Skips removal when the network
# still has active container endpoints, so shared-service networks
# (svc-db-mariadb, svc-db-postgres, …) stay in place while their provider
# container is up. The global `docker network prune -f` sweep that catches
# orphans whose names do NOT match the entity is run once by the orchestrator
# [apps.sh](../apps.sh) after the entity loop.
msgid "Drops the per-entity default Docker network when `compose.sh` left it behind with the wrong / empty `com.docker.compose.network` label (typical between matrix-deploy rounds). Skips removal when the network still has active container endpoints, so shared-service networks (svc-db-mariadb, svc-db-postgres, …) stay in place while their provider container is up. The global `docker network prune -f` sweep that catches orphans whose names do NOT match the entity is run once by the orchestrator [apps.sh](../apps.sh) after the entity loop. Idempotent."
msgstr ""

