msgid "Every selected run is attempted before anything is reported; abandoning the rest on the first rejection would leave them burning runners. `HTTP 409` means the run already finished and is not a rejection at all. Any other rejection is logged as an `ERROR` line, but only a denied token fails the job — a rate limit or a run that vanished between listing and cancel is transient, and a red check for those is a red check nobody reads."
msgstr "모든 선택된 실행은 아무것도 보고되기 전에 시도됩니다; 첫 번째 거부에 나머지를 포기하면 그들은 런너를 점화합니다. `HTTP 409` 이미 끝난 실행을 의미하고 모든 거부가 아닙니다. 다른 거부는 로그인 `ERROR` 라인, 하지만 denied 토큰은 작업 실패 — 비율 제한 또는 목록과 취소 사이에 사라지는 실행은 일시적이며, 그에 대한 빨간색 체크는 빨간색 체크 아무도 읽습니다."

msgid "Every selection names every axis: role, variant, mode, onion state, distro, filesystem, architecture and mesh state. Nothing is left to the rotation."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every server host runs the [log collector](../sys-svc-log-collector/README.md), which pushes its journal to `https://loki.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/loki/api/v1/push`. The vhost serves only that path, only for `POST`, and only with the bearer token `push_token` from `meta/secrets.yml`; it keeps the token's SHA-256, answers `401` without a matching token and `403` for any tenant but `services.loki.tenant`. Every other path answers `404`. `meta/networks.yml` restricts the role to clearnet and the role declares no `tor` service, so the ingest endpoint never answers on an onion address."
msgstr ""

msgid "Every server host runs the `log collector <../sys-svc-log-collector/README.md>`__, which pushes its journal to ``https://loki.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/loki/api/v1/push``. The vhost serves only that path, only for ``POST``, and only with the bearer token ``push_token`` from ``meta/secrets.yml``; it keeps the token’s SHA-256, answers ``401`` without a matching token and ``403`` for any tenant but ``services.loki.tenant``. Every other path answers ``404``. ``meta/networks.yml`` restricts the role to clearnet and the role declares no ``tor`` service, so the ingest endpoint never answers on an onion address."
msgstr ""

