msgid "Extensions of deployed software"
msgstr ""

# Docker-in-Docker에서 reproduced: No-SSO admin persona에 대한 기본 사용자 이름 및 암호 로그인
# fallbacks Akaunting· Snipe-IT YOURLS 이름 * OpenProject; OpenProject는 신뢰할 수있는
# 헤더 SSO에 대한 LDAP auth 소스에 연결 401, 모든 Rails-runner Ruby와 함께 전용 파일로 추출
# *파일/ruby/*; Shopware retries 자산 및 테마는 재시작에 대한 빌드 SeaweedFS; Mailu retries
# 사용자 생성 및 DKIM keygen의 앞에 antispam readiness를 기다립니다; YOURLS는 배치에 그것의 데이타베이스
# 스키마를 창조합니다; 그리고 OpenProject 부츠 db:migrate 아래 Ruby 4.0·.
# reproduced in Docker-in-Docker: native username and password login fallbacks
# for the no-SSO admin persona across Akaunting, Snipe-IT, YOURLS and
# OpenProject; OpenProject linked to the LDAP auth source for header SSO to
# fix a trusted-header 401, with all rails-runner Ruby extracted to dedicated
# files under *files/ruby/*; Shopware retries asset and theme builds against a
# restarting SeaweedFS; Mailu retries user creation and waits for antispam
# readiness before DKIM keygen; YOURLS creates its database schema on deploy;
# and OpenProject boots db:migrate under Ruby 4.0.
msgid "Extensive deploy and end-to-end hardening, much of it reproduced in Docker-in-Docker: native username and password login fallbacks for the no-SSO admin persona across Akaunting, Snipe-IT, YOURLS and OpenProject; OpenProject linked to the LDAP auth source for header SSO to fix a trusted-header 401, with all rails-runner Ruby extracted to dedicated files under *files/ruby/*; Shopware retries asset and theme builds against a restarting SeaweedFS; Mailu retries user creation and waits for antispam readiness before DKIM keygen; YOURLS creates its database schema on deploy; and OpenProject boots db:migrate under Ruby 4.0."
msgstr ""

