# **설정된 소스 저장소에서 (기본 정보 *infinito-nexus/핵심*) CI 범위 전에 발견 실행을 배포하므로 포크 지점 푸시는
# 최신 기지에 대한 자체 변경 만 볼 수 있습니다. 근원은 overridable 또는 disablable를 통해서 입니다
# *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* 저장소 변수 및 sync force-overwrites *이름**, 그래서
# 동기화 된 저장소는 작업 지점으로 사용할 수 없습니다. 이름 * [Actions 설정
# 참조](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)·.
# synchronizes the current repository's *main* from a configured source
# repository (default *infinito-nexus/core*) before CI scope and deploy
# discovery run, so a fork branch push sees only its own changes against an
# up-to-date base. The source is overridable or disablable through the
# *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* repository variable, and the sync
# force-overwrites *main*, so a synced repository must not be used as a
# working branch. See [the Actions configuration
# reference](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md).
msgid "Fork main-branch sync: the push entry workflow now synchronizes the current repository's *main* from a configured source repository (default *infinito-nexus/core*) before CI scope and deploy discovery run, so a fork branch push sees only its own changes against an up-to-date base. The source is overridable or disablable through the *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* repository variable, and the sync force-overwrites *main*, so a synced repository must not be used as a working branch. See [the Actions configuration reference](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."
msgstr ""

