# (JSON 파일 ``{app_id: variant_index}``, 행렬 오케스트라) 활성 변형을 선택하여 핀의 변형
# ``services.*`` 본문 바로가기 ``false`` 변형없는 기본 설정에서 그들을 끌어 당기는 규정 단계 대신 폐쇄에서 그
# 공급자를 prunes. 이미 둥근 지도를 통과하는 In-process callers ``derive_includes(app_id,
# variants=...)``; env var is read only when that 인자 is omitted.
# (JSON``{app_id: variant_index}``, set per round by the matrix orchestrator)
# selects the active variant so a variant that pins``services.*`` flags
# to``false`` prunes those providers from the closure instead of the provision
# step pulling them in from the variant-free base config. In-process callers
# that already hold the round map pass it as``derive_includes(app_id,
# variants=...)``; the env var is read only when that argument is omitted.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Input (env): ``APP_ID``. Optional ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (JSON ``{app_id: variant_index}``, set per round by the matrix orchestrator) selects the active variant so a variant that pins ``services.*`` flags to ``false`` prunes those providers from the closure instead of the provision step pulling them in from the variant-free base config. In-process callers that already hold the round map pass it as ``derive_includes(app_id, variants=...)``; the env var is read only when that argument is omitted."
msgstr ""

