msgid "Mailu is a complete mail server suite delivered as a Docker-based solution. It supports all essential email protocols, offers intuitive administration through a web interface, and integrates advanced security measures such as TLS encryption and virus scanning. Its modular architecture allows for scalable deployments and easy customization to suit diverse operational requirements."
