# web-app-erpnext 역할 - 백엔드, 프론트엔드, websocket, 스케줄러 및 2개의 큐어 노동자 - 중앙으로 타전
# Keycloak 내장을 통해 Keycloak 사회 로그인 키와 중앙으로 OpenLDAP LDAP 설정 doctype을 통해. 3차원
# 매트릭스 (SSO 플러스 LDAP, 아니 오, LDAP 만) 운동 종료 및 repo-wide lint 모자 Ansible 작업 이름
# 120 이름 *.
# '3']
# Framework v15 stack as a web-app-erpnext role — backend, frontend,
# websocket, scheduler and two queue workers — wired into the central Keycloak
# via a built-in Keycloak Social Login Key and into the central OpenLDAP via
# the LDAP Settings doctype. The three-variant matrix (SSO plus LDAP, no auth,
# LDAP only) is exercised end-to-end and a repo-wide lint caps Ansible task
# names at 120.
msgid "New ERPNext role that ships the upstream Frappe Framework v15 stack as a web-app-erpnext role — backend, frontend, websocket, scheduler and two queue workers — wired into the central Keycloak via a built-in Keycloak Social Login Key and into the central OpenLDAP via the LDAP Settings doctype. The three-variant matrix (SSO plus LDAP, no auth, LDAP only) is exercised end-to-end and a repo-wide lint caps Ansible task names at 120 characters."
msgstr ""

