# 발송 Penpot frontend, backend, 수출상 및 경쟁하는 디자인 플랫폼 Redis 이미지 버전 2.5.4, 중앙으로
# 타전하는 Keycloak OIDC를 통해 중앙으로 OpenLDAP. 네이티브 로컬 패스워드 로그인은 SSO 플래그에서 파생 된 네이티브
# 로그인 및 등록 플래그와 함께 OIDC에서 자동으로 비활성화 된 토글로 사용할 수 있습니다. 사용자 정의 JVM truststore 수입
# Infinito 자체 서명 CA 그래서 TLS에 OIDC 성공, 그리고 역할은 OIDC 로그인, 로그 아웃 및 프로젝트 생성을 포함
# Playwright와 함께 종료됩니다. 로컬 서브넷이 이동되었습니다. 192.168.105.192·28 충돌을 방지하기 위해
# ERPNext 범위.
# ships the upstream Penpot design platform comprising frontend, backend,
# exporter and Redis at image version 2.5.4, wired into the central Keycloak
# via OIDC and into the central OpenLDAP. Native local-password login is
# available as a toggle that is disabled automatically under OIDC, with the
# native-login and registration flags derived from the SSO flag. A custom JVM
# truststore imports the Infinito self-signed CA so OIDC over TLS succeeds,
# and the role is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering OIDC login,
# logout and project creation. The local subnet was moved to
# 192.168.105.192/28 to avoid a collision with the ERPNext range.
msgid "New Penpot role (web-app-penpot, requirement 235) that ships the upstream Penpot design platform comprising frontend, backend, exporter and Redis at image version 2.5.4, wired into the central Keycloak via OIDC and into the central OpenLDAP. Native local-password login is available as a toggle that is disabled automatically under OIDC, with the native-login and registration flags derived from the SSO flag. A custom JVM truststore imports the Infinito self-signed CA so OIDC over TLS succeeds, and the role is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering OIDC login, logout and project creation. The local subnet was moved to 192.168.105.192/28 to avoid a collision with the ERPNext range."
msgstr ""

# Pi-hole DNS sinkhole 및 그것의 관리 웹 공용영역과 더불어 네트워크 넓은 광고 차단제, 뒤에 *오우즈2- 프록시* 이름
# * Keycloak RBAC 및 기본 admin-password 로그인 (이름 * *사이트맵* 웹 사이트 API 비밀번호)
# fallback 변형으로 사용할 수 있습니다. 업스트림 리플렉서 및 타임존은 구성이 가능하며, 이 역할은 배포 중에 Pi-hole
# HTTP 엔드포인트를 기다립니다. OAuth를 덮고 Playwright와 함께 종료됩니다.2, native-login 및 게스트 액세스
# 시나리오. lifecycle beta에 역할 배.
# upstream Pi-hole DNS sinkhole and network-wide ad blocker, with its admin
# web interface gated behind *oauth2-proxy* and Keycloak RBAC and a native
# admin-password login (the *FTLCONF* web API password) available as a
# fallback variant. The upstream resolver and timezone are configurable, the
# role waits on the Pi-hole HTTP endpoint during deploy, and it is exercised
# end-to-end with Playwright covering the OAuth2, native-login and
# guest-access scenarios. The role ships at lifecycle beta.
msgid "New Pi-hole role (*web-app-pihole*) that ships the upstream Pi-hole DNS sinkhole and network-wide ad blocker, with its admin web interface gated behind *oauth2-proxy* and Keycloak RBAC and a native admin-password login (the *FTLCONF* web API password) available as a fallback variant. The upstream resolver and timezone are configurable, the role waits on the Pi-hole HTTP endpoint during deploy, and it is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering the OAuth2, native-login and guest-access scenarios. The role ships at lifecycle beta."
msgstr ""

