# 제어 및 파일 시스템 액세스는 게스트 내부에서 실행되며 Hermes의 서브 시약 실행은 게스트 내부이므로 에이전트 실행 시간은 완전히
# isolatable입니다. 호스트 레벨 수요는 Hermes의 웹 대시보드입니다. `network_mode: host` 그리고 공유 호스트
# PID namespace는 디스플레이에만 **이름*** 고립 된 손님이 노출 할 수없는 미터. 즉 host-monitoring 전망은
# severable이고 MUST는 격리한 런타임에서 대리인 층을 끌어당기지 않습니다: 대리인 런타임은 격리되고, 주인 미터 대쉬보드는
# Hermes의 묻힌/in-process 형태에서 뛰어납니다 (감소된 호스트 통계) 또는 분리된 비 격리 `runc` 사이드카.
# OpenClaw's browser control and filesystem access run inside the guest, and
# Hermes' subagent execution runs inside the guest, so the agent runtime is
# fully isolatable. The only host-level demand is Hermes' web dashboard, which
# wants `network_mode: host` and a shared host PID namespace solely to display
# **host** metrics that an isolated guest cannot expose. That host-monitoring
# view is severable and MUST NOT pull the agent tier out of its isolated
# runtime: the agent runtime stays isolated, and the host-metrics dashboard is
# either run in Hermes' embedded/in-process mode (with reduced host stats) or
# split out to a separate non-isolated `runc` sidecar.
msgid "No agent needs host access to do agent work: OpenClaw's browser control and filesystem access run inside the guest, and Hermes' subagent execution runs inside the guest, so the agent runtime is fully isolatable. The only host-level demand is Hermes' web dashboard, which wants `network_mode: host` and a shared host PID namespace solely to display **host** metrics that an isolated guest cannot expose. That host-monitoring view is severable and MUST NOT pull the agent tier out of its isolated runtime: the agent runtime stays isolated, and the host-metrics dashboard is either run in Hermes' embedded/in-process mode (with reduced host stats) or split out to a separate non-isolated `runc` sidecar."
