msgid "Several applications have a useful read API but no MCP server, and several projects ship an MCP server that authenticates *to* the application without authenticating the client calling it. Putting either behind this adapter gives the surface a bearer of its own, an exact tool allowlist, and enforced ceilings. The deployment renders one contract per instance, so the same image serves every provider without any of them sharing a credential or a trust boundary."
