# 렌더링하지만 OIDC 항목 포인트; 만 `/login` SSO 지시어 (자주 묻는 질문
# [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). 공유한 사람은 항상
# 사이트 뿌리에 들어가, 그래서 그들은 결코 도달 할 수 없다 TaigaSSO 버튼 Taiga의 AngularJS 포탄은 추가적으로
# 통나무를 통해서만 드러냅니다 `ng-click` · `tg-nav` · `ui-sref` generic in-app logout
# helper가 활성화할 수 없는 지시어.
# [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) 그러므로 선언
# `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` 이름 * `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; 동등한
# 여행은 역할-지역에 의해 구동된다 `test-login-oidc.js` 이름 * `test-login-native.js` 입력되는
# specs, `/login` 자주 묻는 질문 Taiga's 자체 제어.
# showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only
# `/login` binds the SSO directive (see the note in
# [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). The shared
# personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga's SSO
# button. Taiga's AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through
# `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` directives, which the generic in-app
# logout helper cannot activate.
# [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore
# declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and
# `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the equivalent journeys are driven by
# the role-local `test-login-oidc.js` and `test-login-native.js` specs, which
# enter at `/login` and log out through Taiga's own control.
msgid "Taiga redirects `/` to the public `/discover` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only `/login` binds the SSO directive (see the note in [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga's SSO button. Taiga's AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local `test-login-oidc.js` and `test-login-native.js` specs, which enter at `/login` and log out through Taiga's own control."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects ``/`` to the public ``/discover`` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only ``/login`` binds the SSO directive (see the note in ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` and log out through Taiga’s own control."
msgstr "Taiga 리디렉션 ``/`` 대중에게 ``/discover`` 표시, 이는 베어 로그인 링크를 렌더링하지만 OIDC 항목 포인트; 만 ``/login`` SSO 지시어 (자주 묻는 질문 ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` 자주 묻는 질문 Taiga’ s 자체 제어."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role handles the installation of Firefox using the system’s package manager (``pacman``). It deploys a ``policies.json`` file to Firefox’s distribution directory, ensuring that critical extensions are automatically installed via Firefox Enterprise Policies."
msgstr "아치 리눅스를 위해 tailored, 이 역할은 임명을 취급합니다 Firefox 시스템의 패키지 관리자 사용 (``pacman``). 그것은 배포 ``policies.json`` 파일 형식 Firefox’ s 배포 디렉토리, 그 중요한 확장을 통해 자동으로 설치 Firefox 기업 정책."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role handles the installation of Firefox using the system’s package manager (`pacman`). It deploys a `policies.json` file to Firefox’s distribution directory, ensuring that critical extensions are automatically installed via Firefox Enterprise Policies."
msgstr "아치 리눅스를 위해 tailored, 이 역할은 임명을 취급합니다 Firefox 시스템의 패키지 관리자 사용 (`pacman`). 그것은 배포 `policies.json` 파일 형식 Firefox’ s 배포 디렉토리, 그 중요한 확장을 통해 자동으로 설치 Firefox 기업 정책."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role installs GCC and optionally sets up additional development utilities. It ensures the package is installed via the system package manager and ready to compile code in a variety of programming languages."
msgstr "아치 리눅스에 대한 Tailored, 이 역할은 설치 GCC 그리고 선택적으로 추가 개발 유틸리티를 설정합니다. 시스템 패키지 관리자를 통해 패키지를 설치하고 다양한 프로그래밍 언어로 코드를 컴파일 할 준비가되어 있습니다."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role monitors containers for failure states and initiates a controlled restart of affected Compose configurations. If port conflicts prevent recovery, the role stops the affected stack, restarts Docker, and recreates the container environment."
msgstr "아치 리눅스를 위해 tailored, 이 역할은 실패 국가를 위한 콘테이너를 감시하고 영향을 받는 Compose 윤곽의 통제되는 재시작을 개시합니다. 포트 충돌이 복구를 방지하는 경우, 역할은 영향을받은 스택을 중지하고 Docker를 다시 시작하고 컨테이너 환경을 재구성합니다."

