# `build/install-lint-<hash>.stamp` (suffix는 첫번째입니다 8 숯
# `sha256(sys.executable)`, 그래서 주인과 콘테이너 궤도는 그러나 자주적으로 추적합니다 `build/` 묶음 상품).
# 스탬프 의존성 [lint.sh](../../../scripts/install/lint.sh) 이름 *
# [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml). Group-targeted invocations는 항상 뛰고
# 우표를 만지지 않습니다.
# `build/install-lint-<hash>.stamp` (the suffix is the first 8 chars of
# `sha256(sys.executable)`, so host and container track independently even
# though `build/` is bind-mounted). Stamp dependencies are
# [lint.sh](../../../scripts/install/lint.sh) and
# [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml). Group-targeted invocations always
# run and never touch the stamp.
msgid "The `all` mode honors a per-interpreter stamp at `build/install-lint-<hash>.stamp` (the suffix is the first 8 chars of `sha256(sys.executable)`, so host and container track independently even though `build/` is bind-mounted). Stamp dependencies are [lint.sh](../../../scripts/install/lint.sh) and [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml). Group-targeted invocations always run and never touch the stamp."
msgstr ""

