# ``host-gateway``: alias가 노드당 해결을 하면서 openresty 출판물 :80 이름 * ``mode: host``
# 이름 * ``node.role == manager``, 그래서 worker에 모든 복제는 자체 게이트웨이를 다이얼하고 토큰 교환은 '연결
# 거부'로 사망 (7₢ 킹1839681, 실행중인 penpot에 측정하는 31340965955). Swarm 그러므로 스택 호스트의 룰렛
# 주소를 가져옵니다 -- 목적지 svc-net-tor 이미 모든 숨겨진 서비스 트래픽을 보냅니다. ``ansible_facts``
# compose 파일이 인벤토리 호스트와 swarm과 함께 한 번 렌더링되기 때문에 운반 ``extra_hosts`` 모든 작업에.
# and in swarm it must NOT be <x id="0"></x>: that alias resolves per node,
# while openresty publishes :<x id="1"></x> with <x id="2"></x> under <x
# id="3"></x>, so every replica on a worker dialled its own gateway and the
# token exchange died with 'Connection refused' <x id="4"></x><x id="5"></x><x
# id="6"></x>, measured on penpot in run <x id="7"></x><x id="8"></x><x
# id="9"></x>. Swarm therefore gets the stack host's routable address -- the
# destination <x id="10"></x> already sends all hidden-service traffic to. <x
# id="11"></x> carries it because the compose file is rendered once with the
# manager as inventory host and swarm applies the same <x id="12"></x> to
# every task.
msgid "The automatic pin follows the effective deploy mode, and in swarm it must NOT be ``host-gateway``: that alias resolves per node, while openresty publishes :80 with ``mode: host`` under ``node.role == manager``, so every replica on a worker dialled its own gateway and the token exchange died with 'Connection refused' (7b1839681, measured on penpot in run 31340965955). Swarm therefore gets the stack host's routable address -- the destination svc-net-tor already sends all hidden-service traffic to. ``ansible_facts`` carries it because the compose file is rendered once with the manager as inventory host and swarm applies the same ``extra_hosts`` to every task."
msgstr ""

