# ``backup.yml`` 이름 * ``INV_PATH`` (이름 * host_vars 뚱 베어), 클러스터 한 후 두 번째 놀이로
# 배치. 없음 svc-swarm-node 재생하는 그룹 DEPLOYMENT_MODE=compose와 IS_STACK_HOST백업 호스트에
# =true, 그래서 클러스터 회원 특별한 경우없이 실행 백업 역할.
# gained=['*', 'IS_STACK_HOST백업']
# inventory: it lives in a sibling ``backup.yml`` next to ``INV_PATH`` (same
# host_vars dir), deployed as a second play after the cluster one. Without a
# svc-swarm-node group that play resolves DEPLOYMENT_MODE=compose and
# IS_STACK_HOST=true on the backup host, so the backup roles run without
# cluster-membership special cases.
msgid "The backup host is NOT appended to the cluster inventory: it lives in a sibling ``backup.yml`` next to ``INV_PATH`` (same host_vars dir), deployed as a second play after the cluster one. Without a svc-swarm-node group that play resolves DEPLOYMENT_MODE=compose and IS_STACK_HOST=true on the backup host, so the backup roles run without cluster-membership special cases."
