# 케이스가 휴식 : 그의 실행 `head_repository` 이름 * API omits 및 헤드 포크가 삭제 된 풀 요청, 이벤트
# 페이로드는 헤드 저장소를 운반하지 않습니다. 둘 다 혼자 분지 이름에 일치합니다, 그렇지 않으면 그들의 실행은 영원히 계속 될 것입니다
# — 그리고 필드는 기여자가 영향을 미칠 수있는 무언가입니다. ambiguity 체크 위는 안전하다는 것을 이다: 그것은 머리 분지가
# repository 없이, 또는, 이렇게 공유한 분지 이름 아직도 잘못된 잡아당기기 요구 취소 보다는 오히려 일치를 무능하게 할 수
# 있는다.
# run's head repository to be the pull request's own. Two cases relax that: a
# run whose `head_repository` the API omits, and a pull request whose head
# fork has been deleted, where the event payload carries no head repository
# either. Both are matched on the branch name alone, because otherwise their
# runs would keep going forever — and neither field is something a contributor
# can influence. The ambiguity check above is what makes that safe: it runs
# whenever a head branch is known, with or without a repository, so a shared
# branch name still disables the matcher rather than cancelling the wrong pull
# request.
msgid "The branch-name matcher normally also requires the run's head repository to be the pull request's own. Two cases relax that: a run whose `head_repository` the API omits, and a pull request whose head fork has been deleted, where the event payload carries no head repository either. Both are matched on the branch name alone, because otherwise their runs would keep going forever — and neither field is something a contributor can influence. The ambiguity check above is what makes that safe: it runs whenever a head branch is known, with or without a repository, so a shared branch name still disables the matcher rather than cancelling the wrong pull request."
msgstr ""

