# omitted 때 기본값으로. 더 보기 ``is_proxy_gated`` predicate는 인코딩 한 곳입니다. "오우스2-proxy
# sidecar 이 역할 앞" — 각 다른 층 MUST는 이 돕기 대신에 간접합니다 ``enabled AND flavor ==
# 'oauth2'`` 화합물. 더 보기 ``oauth2_*`` 키가 게이트 업스트림 구성을 노출 그래서 전화 사이트는 리터럴보다 오히려 한
# 개의 이름의 속성을 통해 크로스로드 데이터를 해결 ``lookup('config', app_id,
# 'services.sso.oauth2.<sub>')`` (그렇지 않으면 리터-protocol-lookup 및
# lookup-config-path static-scan 가드를 여행 할 것)·.
# ``oidc`` as the default when omitted. The ``is_proxy_gated`` predicate is
# the one place that encodes "the oauth2-proxy sidecar fronts this role" —
# every other layer MUST consult this helper instead of re-implementing the
# ``enabled AND flavor == 'oauth2'`` compound. The ``oauth2_*`` keys expose
# the gated upstream config so call sites resolve cross-role data through one
# named property rather than a literal ``lookup('config', app_id,
# 'services.sso.oauth2.<sub>')`` (which would otherwise trip the
# literal-protocol-lookup and lookup-config-path static-scan guards).
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The flavor enum is ``{oidc, oauth2, saml}`` with ``oidc`` as the default when omitted. The ``is_proxy_gated`` predicate is the one place that encodes \"the oauth2-proxy sidecar fronts this role\" — every other layer MUST consult this helper instead of re-implementing the ``enabled AND flavor == 'oauth2'`` compound. The ``oauth2_*`` keys expose the gated upstream config so call sites resolve cross-role data through one named property rather than a literal ``lookup('config', app_id, 'services.sso.oauth2.<sub>')`` (which would otherwise trip the literal-protocol-lookup and lookup-config-path static-scan guards)."
msgstr ""

