# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The service runs as a lightweight Node.js app backed by PostgreSQL."
msgstr "이 서비스는 경량화 Node.js 앱 백업 PostgreSQL·."

msgid "The service sits behind the oauth2-proxy gate of [web-app-keycloak](../web-app-keycloak/) without a group requirement. Its gate sets `any_email`, so it admits a realm user of any email domain. It reads the requester only from the gate's headers, never from the form."
