msgid "The sets dnsmasq fills (`tor_dns_*`, `direct_dns_*`) expire after `TOR_EGRESS_NFTSET_TIMEOUT` (1h). dnsmasq caps its cache at `max-cache-ttl=300`, so a client that keeps resolving refreshes its entry, and the deploy sends dnsmasq `SIGHUP` after every firewall reload so the next answers refill the emptied sets."
msgstr ""

# }`. 이것은 위험한 거짓 보안 상태를 방지합니다: OS-level sandbox 백엔드가면 (사이트맵 `bwrap` 리눅스에서,
# `sandbox-exec` macOS에서) 누락되거나 비 기능, Claude Code 그렇지 않으면 조용히 모래로 떨어졌다 동안
# `autoAllowBashIfSandboxed` 자동 승인 명령으로 계속됩니다. 이름 * `failIfUnavailable: true`·
# Claude Code 그 상황에서 진행을 거부, 연산자를 강제로 누락 된 백엔드 또는 명시적으로 어떤 명령 실행 전에 정책을 내려. 작업
# sandbox 백엔드 MUST가 로컬로 약화하는 것보다 적절한 바이너리를 설치하지 않고 시스템에 기여합니다.
# "failIfUnavailable": true }`. This prevents a dangerous false-security
# state: if the OS-level sandbox backend (e.g. `bwrap` on Linux,
# `sandbox-exec` on macOS) is missing or non-functional, Claude Code would
# otherwise silently fall back to no sandboxing while
# `autoAllowBashIfSandboxed` continues to auto-approve commands as if they
# were confined. With `failIfUnavailable: true`, Claude Code refuses to
# proceed in that situation, forcing the operator to install the missing
# backend or explicitly downgrade the policy before any command runs.
# Contributors on systems without a working sandbox backend MUST install the
# appropriate binary rather than weakening this flag locally.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The settings file additionally sets `\"sandbox\": { \"failIfUnavailable\": true }`. This prevents a dangerous false-security state: if the OS-level sandbox backend (e.g. `bwrap` on Linux, `sandbox-exec` on macOS) is missing or non-functional, Claude Code would otherwise silently fall back to no sandboxing while `autoAllowBashIfSandboxed` continues to auto-approve commands as if they were confined. With `failIfUnavailable: true`, Claude Code refuses to proceed in that situation, forcing the operator to install the missing backend or explicitly downgrade the policy before any command runs. Contributors on systems without a working sandbox backend MUST install the appropriate binary rather than weakening this flag locally."
msgstr ""

