# [files/playwright/_shared.js](./files/playwright/_shared.js) 그리고 전용 로그인
# specs를 구동 `files/playwright/`·.
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Pixelfed's login id is the account e-mail rather than the Keycloak username, and the artisan-bootstrapped administrator name is reserved, so pixelfed's first-time OIDC registration cannot mint it either. `biber` additionally needs his Keycloak e-mail rewritten to a resolvable domain through the Keycloak admin API before the first OIDC login, because pixelfed's `dns,spoof` validator rejects `.example` addresses. Both setups live in [files/playwright/_shared.js](./files/playwright/_shared.js) and drive the dedicated login specs in `files/playwright/`."
msgstr ""

# 선언합니다. [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2)·
# OpenTalk frontend는 공개 클라이언트 OIDC 단일 페이지 앱입니다. 컨테이너 env는 아무 것도 운반하지만 발행인과
# 클라이언트 ID는 서버 측 세션이 없으며 HTML 로그인 양식이 없습니다. 따라서 역할은 자체 리디렉터링 헬퍼로 구동됩니다.
# `LOGIN_*` · `BIBER_*` 대신에 `ADMIN_*` 공유 헬퍼가 기대하고, 브라우저 측 세션은 대상없이 계약의 인앱 로그아웃
# 다리를 나타낸다. 두 사람 Keycloak → 대시보드 체인이 적용됨
# [files/playwright/test-sso-login.js](./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js)·.
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). The OpenTalk frontend is a public-client OIDC single-page app — the container env carries nothing but the issuer and the client id, there is no server-side session and no HTML login form — so the role drives it with its own redirect-racing helper keyed on `LOGIN_*` / `BIBER_*` instead of the `ADMIN_*` pair the shared helper expects, and the browser-side session leaves the contract's in-app logout leg without a target. Both personas' Keycloak → dashboard chain is covered by [files/playwright/test-sso-login.js](./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js)."
msgstr ""

# 선언합니다. [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). 역할은
# pretix 계정이 전혀 없습니다. — [tasks/main.yml](./tasks/main.yml) pretix의 네이티브 auth
# 백엔드가 pretix를 정복하면서 스택만 배포합니다. `User` 상호 작용하는 첫번째 실행 체제에 의해 창조되는 줄. 더 보기
# `pretix-oidc` pretix의 최고 생활에 백엔드 추가 `/control` 로그인 페이지, 역할의 기본 URL은 기본 시나리오에
# 대한 공개 티켓 상점을 제공합니다
# [files/playwright/playwright.spec.js](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js)
# 파일 형식 backend 사용자를 Seeding은 runnable persona 여행으로 돌아갑니다.
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). The role provisions no pretix account at all — [tasks/main.yml](./tasks/main.yml) only deploys the stack — while pretix's native auth backend authenticates a pretix `User` row that is created by the interactive first-run setup. The `pretix-oidc` backend added on top lives on pretix's `/control` login page, whereas the role's base URL serves the public ticket shop that the baseline scenarios in [files/playwright/playwright.spec.js](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) assert. Seeding a backend user is the path back to a runnable persona journey."
msgstr ""

# `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` · `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` 내 계정
# `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Fider의 SSO 항목은 두 단계 modal입니다 : 헤더 "이름 *" 버튼은
# 공급자 대화 상자를 열고 두 번째 클릭 "계속 ... SSO" 수행하기 Keycloak 리디렉션, 공유 헬퍼가 즉시 클릭하고 IdP에
# 도달하지 않습니다. 둘 다 여행은 이 역할의 자신의 끝에 끝을 덮습니다 `fider: admin sso login` 이름 *
# `fider: biber sso login as regular user` 현재 위치
# `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`; 공유 helper 학습 한 번의 옵트 아웃 함 Fider아파치 모듈
# modal.
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Fider's SSO entry is a two-step modal: the header \"Sign in\" button only opens the provider dialog, and a second click on \"Continue with … SSO\" performs the Keycloak redirect, whereas the shared helper clicks exactly once and never reaches the IdP. Both journeys are covered end-to-end by this role's own `fider: admin sso login` and `fider: biber sso login as regular user` scenarios in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`; the opt-out lapses once the shared helper learns Fider's modal."
msgstr ""

# `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` · `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` 내 계정
# `templates/playwright.env.j2`. OIDC 변종 이상, `templates/casc.yaml.j2` 선택하기
# `ldap` 또는 `local` 보안 영역 및 Jenkins'만 로그인 표면은 그 자체 Java-realm 형태, 그 분야는 명명
# `j_username` · `j_password` (LDAP 시나리오에 의해 핀
# `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`) — 공유 네이티브로 로그인 프로브가 일치하지 않습니다, 그래서
# 사람은 결코 인증하지 않습니다. 깃발은 현재 무조건이다; 그것에 좁히기 `{% if not JENKINS_OIDC_ENABLED %}`
# OIDC 인스타 여행이 확정된 후 종료된 경로가 다시 시작됩니다.
# journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` /
# `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Outside
# the OIDC variant, `templates/casc.yaml.j2` selects the `ldap` or `local`
# security realm and Jenkins' only login surface is its own Java-realm form,
# whose fields are named `j_username` / `j_password` (pinned by the LDAP
# scenario in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`) — names the shared
# native-login probe does not match, so the persona never authenticates. The
# flag is currently unconditional; narrowing it to `{% if not
# JENKINS_OIDC_ENABLED %}` once the OIDC persona journey has been verified
# end-to-end is the path back.
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Outside the OIDC variant, `templates/casc.yaml.j2` selects the `ldap` or `local` security realm and Jenkins' only login surface is its own Java-realm form, whose fields are named `j_username` / `j_password` (pinned by the LDAP scenario in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`) — names the shared native-login probe does not match, so the persona never authenticates. The flag is currently unconditional; narrowing it to `{% if not JENKINS_OIDC_ENABLED %}` once the OIDC persona journey has been verified end-to-end is the path back."
msgstr ""

msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. The site front page renders no logout control: Joomla's site template places no login module, and the only rendered Log out button sits on the com_users login view, so the persona's mandatory in-app logout click on the front page has no target and navigating a logout URL directly is forbidden by the contract. The OIDC handshake itself, the Keycloak logout from the com_users Log out button, the LDAP variant and the `/administrator?fallback=local` hatch are covered by `files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js`, `test-sso-logout.js`, `test-ldap-login.js` and `test-oidc-fallback.js`."
msgstr ""

msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. `biber` holds no FusionDirectory role, so the oauth2-proxy denies it. [`files/playwright/test-rbac.js`](./files/playwright/test-rbac.js) asserts that denial and adds `biber` to each role group in turn to assert the rights of the matching ACL role. The shared admin flow has not been verified against the header login. [`files/playwright/test-design.js`](./files/playwright/test-design.js) asserts the administrator's sign-in and rights in both variants, and [`files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) asserts that the Keycloak sign-in lands in FusionDirectory without a second login form."
msgstr ""

# `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` · `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` 내 계정
# `templates/playwright.env.j2`· web-app-hugo statically 내장 된 사이트를 제공합니다 :
# `services.sso` 열심히 disabled `meta/services.yml`, 콘테이너는 입니다 Hugo nginx로 구운 빌드
# (`templates/compose.yml.j2`), Playwright env 파일 렌더링 `ADMIN_*` · `BIBER_*`
# 자격. 세션이 없습니다, 관리자 표면 및 로그 아웃 제어 드라이브, 그래서 `guest` persona plus the
# Reachability, CSP 및 렌더링 HTML assertions는이 역할에 대한 완전한 계약입니다.
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. web-app-hugo serves a statically built site: `services.sso` is hard-disabled in `meta/services.yml`, the container is a Hugo build baked into nginx (`templates/compose.yml.j2`), and the Playwright env file renders no `ADMIN_*` / `BIBER_*` credentials. There is no session, no admin surface and no logout control to drive, so the `guest` persona plus the reachability, CSP and rendered-HTML assertions are the complete contract for this role."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` persona journey is opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. A Jellyfin account binds to exactly one authentication provider, so biber's login is owned by the per-addon specs that know which provider is live: `files/playwright/addons/sso-authentication.spec.js` for OIDC and `addons/ldap-authentication.spec.js` for the LDAP-only matrix variant. The generic persona cannot pick between them and would duplicate or contradict that coverage; `playwright.spec.js` keeps the `guest` scenario and the native administrator login."
msgstr "공유하기 `biber` persona 여행은 통해 선택됩니다 `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` 내 계정 `templates/playwright.env.j2`· Jellyfin 계정을 정확히 하나의 인증 공급자에 바인딩, 그래서 biber의 로그인은 공급자가 살고있는 것을 알고있는 per-addon specs에 의해 소유된다: `files/playwright/addons/sso-authentication.spec.js` OIDC 및 `addons/ldap-authentication.spec.js` LDAP 전용 매트릭스 변형을 위해. 일반적인 사람은 그들 사이에서 선택할 수 없으며 복제하거나 금전적 인 경우; `playwright.spec.js` 계속하기 `guest` 시나리오와 네이티브 관리자 로그인."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `default.json.j2` MUST stay generic. App-specific protocol mappers, claims, or scopes MUST NOT be added there because the change affects every other client."
msgstr "공유하기 `default.json.j2` MUST 체재 일반적인. App-specific Protocol mappers, 클레임, 또는 범위는 변경이 다른 클라이언트에 영향을 미치기 때문에 추가되지 않습니다."

msgid "The shared element styles (`body`, links, buttons, form fields, tables, focus outline) sit in the cascade layer `infinito-design`. `layer.css` is linked first in `<head>` and declares that layer before the app's own stylesheets, so every rule of the app wins over them, layered or not. They only style what the app leaves unstyled."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared root file comes first and carries ``None`` as its role."
msgstr "공유 루트 파일이 먼저 와서 운반 ``None`` 그 역할."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared schema and first end-to-end slice MAY land together."
msgstr "공유 된 스키마와 첫 번째 엔드 투 엔드 슬라이 땅 함께."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared schema, loader, lint, and the first migrated role MAY land together."
msgstr "공유 schema, 로더, lint, 그리고 함께 최초의 migrated 역할 MAY 땅."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shell prefix, or an empty string when email is disabled."
msgstr "이메일이 비활성화되면 쉘 접두사 또는 빈 문자열."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The shell-side installer scripts loop over distros with their own variable, so they render ``{slug}`` themselves rather than per distro."
msgstr "Shell-side installer scripts loop over distros with their variable, 그래서 그들은 렌더링 ``{slug}`` 디트로에 비해 스스로."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shipped weights are `locality: 1.0`, `cost: 0.4`, `speed: 0.25`, `caching: 0.15`, `throughput: 0.1`, and the constraint behind them is that locality **exceeds** the sum of the others, so no combination of the rest outscores staying in the cluster. That is a preference, not the protection: decision 7's restriction removes remote candidates before this runs, which is why a weighting that sends everything to the cheapest provider still cannot send a credential there."
msgstr "배송된 중량은 `locality: 1.0`· `cost: 0.4`· `speed: 0.25`· `caching: 0.15`· `throughput: 0.1`, 그리고 그 뒤에 제약은 그 지역이다 **더 보기** 다른 사람의 합, 그래서 클러스터에 머무는 나머지 outscores의 조합. 그것은 선호도, 보호 되지: 결정 7's 제한은이 실행하기 전에 원격 후보를 제거합니다. 왜 가장 저렴한 공급자에게 모든 것을 보내지 않는 이유는 여전히 자격 증명을 보낼 수 없습니다."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shipped weights keep locality worth at least the other factors combined"
msgstr "배송된 중량은 합리적으로 다른 요소가 합리적으로 유지됩니다."

msgid "The short human form of a plan: one line per tier and per row, the cuts last."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The short version:"
msgstr "짧은 버전:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar authenticates a Gitea token"
msgstr "Sidecar 인증 Gitea 토큰 토큰"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar creates its consumer's bucket itself at startup because a swarm stack's converge gate blocks before any post-deploy task could create it, deadlocking consumers that hard-fail on a missing bucket (e.g. the OpenTalk controller). The stock entrypoint routes every argv through ``weed`` (``sh`` as a command would become ``weed sh``), so the template overrides it with ``sh -c``; the server itself is still launched via ``/entrypoint.sh`` to keep its /data chown, privilege drop, and default server args."
msgstr "Sidecar는 회전대 스택의 융합 게이트 블록이 모든 포스트 배포 작업이 만들 수 있기 때문에 소비자의 양동이 자체를 만듭니다. 누락된 버킷에 경화 된 소비자를 막을 수 있습니다. (예. OpenTalk 관련 링크). 모든 argv를 통해 재고 항목 경로 ``weed`` (``sh`` 명령으로 ``weed sh``), 그래서 템플릿은 그것을 overrides ``sh -c``; 서버 자체는 아직도 통해 발사됩니다 ``/entrypoint.sh`` /data chown, 특전 드롭 및 기본 서버 args를 유지하십시오."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar is never routed publicly. A bearerless probe of `/mcp` on the public vhost is answered with an SSO redirect, never with an MCP response."
msgstr "사이드카는 결코 공개적으로 갈 수 없습니다. bearerless 조사의 `/mcp` 공개 vhost는 SSO 리디렉션과 대답하여 MCP 응답을 절대로하지 않습니다."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar is never routed publicly. A bearerless probe of ``/mcp`` on the public vhost is answered with an SSO redirect, never with an MCP response."
msgstr "사이드카는 결코 공개적으로 갈 수 없습니다. bearerless 조사의 ``/mcp`` 공개 vhost는 SSO 리디렉션과 대답하여 MCP 응답을 절대로하지 않습니다."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar is reachable on the container network only, so a client probes it from inside the stack:"
msgstr "Sidecar는 컨테이너 네트워크에만 도달 할 수 있으므로 클라이언트는 스택 내부에서 그것을 조사합니다."

# whitelists 다만 기계 API 계정 정보 (`/translate`· `/detect`, ...); 참조
# [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). 앱 내부, 권한은 API-key-tier만 입력하고
# IdP에서 decoupled [단일 사인온](#single-sign-on) 위. 비admin 방문자는 UI 세션이 없으므로
# [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) 이름 *
# `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`· `administrator` 이름 * `guest` manas 실행
# unconditionally.
msgid "The sidecar oauth2-proxy admits only the LibreTranslate administrator RBAC group and whitelists just the machine API paths (`/translate`, `/detect`, …); see [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). Inside the app, authorisation is API-key-tier only and decoupled from the IdP, as documented under [Single sign-on](#single-sign-on) above. A non-admin visitor therefore has no UI session to drive, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. The `administrator` and `guest` personas run unconditionally."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar oauth2-proxy admits only the LibreTranslate administrator RBAC group and whitelists just the machine API paths (``/translate``, ``/detect``, …); see ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__. Inside the app, authorisation is API-key-tier only and decoupled from the IdP, as documented under `Single sign-on <#single-sign-on>`__ above. A non-admin visitor therefore has no UI session to drive, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``. The ``administrator`` and ``guest`` personas run unconditionally."
msgstr "사이드카 oauth2-proxy는 만 인정 LibreTranslate 관리자 RBAC 그룹과 whitelists 다만 기계 API 계정 정보 (``/translate``· ``/detect``, ...); 참조 ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__. Inside the app, authorisation is API-key-tier only and decoupled from the IdP, as documented under `단일 사인온 <#single-sign-on>`__ above. A non-admin visitor therefore has no UI session to drive, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``. The ``administrator`` and ``guest`` manas 실행 unconditionally."

msgid "The sidecar reaches the engine over the shared object-store network, so the console can be deployed, removed or left out of a node without touching the store. A node that does not run this role keeps its object store and its S3 endpoint; it simply has no browser console."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar reads its upstream credential from an ``upstream.env`` file rather than from the compose environment, because the app password does not exist when the stack is first rendered. ```tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` <./tasks/utils/mcp.yml>`__ writes that file after the mint and recreates the sidecar through ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter``\\ ’s ``rebuild.yml``: ``compose up`` resolves ``env_file`` while creating the container, which a restart would not."
msgstr "Sidecar는 상류 자격 증명을 읽습니다. ``upstream.env`` 컴파일 환경보다 오히려 파일, 앱 암호가 스택이 처음 렌더링 될 때 존재하지 않기 때문에. ```tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` <./tasks/utils/mcp.yml>`__ writes that file after the mint and recreates the sidecar through ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter``\\ ’s ``rebuild.yml``: ``compose up`` resolves ``env_file`` 컨테이너를 만드는 동안 재시작하지 않을 것입니다."

# 파일, 앱 암호가 스택이 처음 렌더링 될 때 존재하지 않기 때문에.
# [`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) mint 후 파일을 작성하고 sidecar를 다시
# 생성 `svc-ai-mcp-adapter`이름 * `rebuild.yml`:: `compose up` 해결 방법 `env_file`
# 컨테이너를 만드는 동안 재시작하지 않을 것입니다.
msgid "The sidecar reads its upstream credential from an `upstream.env` file rather than from the compose environment, because the app password does not exist when the stack is first rendered. [`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) writes that file after the mint and recreates the sidecar through `svc-ai-mcp-adapter`'s `rebuild.yml`: `compose up` resolves `env_file` while creating the container, which a restart would not."
msgstr ""

