msgid "The sweeper of the shared folders and the models removes related files together: an npm `_cacache` index bucket with the content files only it references, a pip `http-v2` entry with its `.body`, a pacman package with its `.sig`, and a Playwright browser directory as a whole; `ms-playwright/.links` stays. A model unit is a whole package directory or file below a tool's folder (`models/libretranslate/<package>`), or an Ollama manifest together with the blobs no other manifest references; the sweeper skips the models folder while a running container mounts it. It never removes a cache root, a directory that is not a unit, or anything outside the cache paths. On a filesystem mounted `noatime` it reads the modification time instead of the access time, and `make cache-status` reports `atime_fallback: true` for that cache."
msgstr ""

