msgid "The target carries no container engine and no SSH host key of its own: a deploy under test installs `docker-ce`, and `target-host-keys.service` generates host keys when a container boots. Its `/var/lib/docker` is the named volume `INFINITO_RUNNER_PREFIX-target-docker`, so the engine a deploy installs writes to a real filesystem. The volume is named, not anonymous, because `sys-ctl-hlth-volumes` fails on every anonymous volume of the outer daemon, which is the operator's own host on a workstation that also runs a deployed stack. The checkout is mounted at `INFINITO_SRC_DIR`, where a host install replays from it."
