msgid "This is the single deploy-coupled seam the main path calls per scenario. *execute* performs the stack interaction and returns the result word (``passed`` / ``failed`` / ``skipped``); it is injected so the surrounding selection and reporting logic is tested without a stack. The default executor does not touch a stack (see :func:`_default_execute`)."
