msgid "This role aggregates various GNOME desktop components to ensure a cohesive and fully functional GNOME environment on Arch Linux. It includes the installation and configuration of several sub-roles:"
msgstr "이 역할은 다양한 GNOME 데스크탑 구성 요소로 Arch Linux의 공동성과 완전성 GNOME 환경을 보장합니다. 그것은 몇몇 잠수함의 임명 그리고 윤곽을 포함합니다:"

msgid "This role asserts that the mount, source, and target configuration values are present, deploys the rsync-driver script, and installs a systemd mount unit plus a oneshot service. The oneshot service is triggered automatically when the configured mount path appears, so the only operator action is to physically plug the device in. The filesystem mounted at the configured mount path must store owners, POSIX ACLs and extended attributes (for example ext4 or xfs). The backup runs ``rsync -aHAXP``, which fails on FAT or exFAT."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role asserts that the mount, source, and target configuration values are present, deploys the rsync-driver script, and installs a systemd mount unit plus a oneshot service. The oneshot service is triggered automatically when the configured mount path appears, so the only operator action is to physically plug the device in. The filesystem mounted at the configured mount path must store owners, POSIX ACLs and extended attributes (for example ext4 or xfs). The backup runs `rsync -aHAXP`, which fails on FAT or exFAT."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the cleanup of old backups by executing a Python script that deletes outdated backup versions based on disk usage thresholds. It ensures that backup storage does not exceed a defined usage percentage."
msgstr "이 역할 automates the cleanup of old backups by executing the Python script that delete outdated backup version based on disk usage thresholds. 그것은 백업 저장은 정의 된 사용 비율을 초과하지 않습니다."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the creation of a swapfile on the target system by cloning a swapfile creation script from a Git repository and executing it with the specified swapfile size."
msgstr "이 역할 automates the create of a swapfile on the target system by cloning a swapfile 생성 스크립트 from Git repository 및 지정된 swapfile 크기로 실행."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment and configuration of a complete, production-ready Taiga stack using Docker Compose. It ensures integration with common infrastructure tools such as NGINX, PostgreSQL, and RabbitMQ, while optionally enabling OpenID Connect authentication for enterprise-grade SSO."
msgstr "이 역할 automates the 배포 및 구성의 완전한, 생산-ready Taiga 스택 사용 Docker Compose. NGINX와 같은 일반적인 인프라 도구와 통합을 보장합니다. PostgreSQL· RabbitMQ, 선택적으로 기업 급료 SSO를 위한 OpenID 연결 입증을 가능하게 하는 동안."

# translated-by: libretranslate
