# MP4 archives. The deployment integrates with the shared Keycloak realm via
# OIDC and reuses ``svc-db-postgres`` and ``web-svc-coturn`` for relational
# data and STUN/TURN. For identity wiring details see `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__
