msgid "This role turns a Debian or Arch host into the local hypervisor for agent VM workspaces. It installs Incus, refuses a host without `/dev/kvm`, creates the agent storage pool on a copy-on-write driver and an agent bridge without NAT, and creates one restricted project `agents-<instance>` per Infinito.Nexus instance. The agent broker (`svc-ai-agent-broker`) clones one VM per task from the agent VM template into that project and destroys it when the task ends."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role turns a Debian or Arch host into the local hypervisor for agent VM workspaces. It installs Incus, refuses a host without ``/dev/kvm``, creates the agent storage pool on a copy-on-write driver and an agent bridge without NAT, and creates one restricted project ``agents-<instance>`` per Infinito.Nexus instance. The agent broker (``svc-ai-agent-broker``) clones one VM per task from the agent VM template into that project and destroys it when the task ends."
msgstr ""

