msgid "Two listener layers:"
msgstr "2명의 청취자 층:"

msgid "Two lists, each with its own exception list: `tor` (always through Tor) and `direct` (never through Tor). Entries are host names, `*.` wildcards, IPs and CIDRs. `except` removes matches from its own `include`."
msgstr ""

# 시작에 정박됩니다 (옵션 indent 후) arbitrary 작업 출력의 하위 문자열은 상태를 가짜 수 없습니다. 그리고 불안정한
# `log_path` 이름 * (`ANSIBLE_LOG_PATH`, swarm/compose 배포 피드 이 verifier) 모든 선을
# 접목 `<ts> p=<pid> u=<user> n=<name> <LVL>| `; prefix가 선 닻과 둘 다 패배하는 것을
# unstripped 왼쪽 `\nTASK [` 구획 분할, 그래서 각 필수 역할은 거짓 positive 것과 같이 "실행되지 않음"·.
# unstripped 왼쪽 `nTASK [` 구획 분할, 그래서 각 필수 역할은 거짓 positive 것과 같이 "실행되지 않음"·.
msgid "Two log-parsing trip-wires shape the regexes below. The non-skip status match is anchored to line start (after optional indent) so a substring in arbitrary task output cannot fake a status. And Ansible's `log_path` file (`ANSIBLE_LOG_PATH`, what the swarm/compose deploy feeds this verifier) prefixes every line with `<ts> p=<pid> u=<user> n=<name> <LVL>| `; left unstripped that prefix defeats both the line anchor and the `\\nTASK [` block split, so every required role would false-positive as \"did not execute\"."
msgstr ""

msgid "Two mechanical consequences follow and are implemented with it. `format` travels with a request instead of being pinned to `text` in the LibreTranslate backend, because a tag sent in text mode is translated rather than preserved, and it joins the cache key so a text-mode answer is never served to an html-mode request. A caller may name protected spans of its own alongside the Weblate glossary, because a masked placeholder is not a glossary term and a prompted backend has no html mode to protect it with."
msgstr ""

# [`svc-db-mariadb`](../../roles/svc-db-mariadb/) 이름 *
# [`svc-db-redis`](../../roles/svc-db-redis/) — 및 중앙 서비스 컨벤션 당 재사용됩니다. Frappe의
# 세 Redis 논리적인 역할은 단일 중앙에 의해 봉사합니다 Redis 별도 DB 번호를 사용하는 경우 (Frappe는 상자를 통해 밖으로
# 지원합니다 `redis_cache` · `redis_queue` · `redis_socketio` config 항목)·.
# Infinito.Nexus service equivalent —
# [`svc-db-mariadb`](../../roles/svc-db-mariadb/) and
# [`svc-db-redis`](../../roles/svc-db-redis/) — and MUST be reused per the
# central-service convention. Frappe's three Redis logical roles are served by
# a single central Redis instance using distinct DB numbers (Frappe supports
# that out of the box via `redis_cache` / `redis_queue` / `redis_socketio`
# config entries).
msgid "Two of those data-plane dependencies have a central Infinito.Nexus service equivalent — [`svc-db-mariadb`](../../roles/svc-db-mariadb/) and [`svc-db-redis`](../../roles/svc-db-redis/) — and MUST be reused per the central-service convention. Frappe's three Redis logical roles are served by a single central Redis instance using distinct DB numbers (Frappe supports that out of the box via `redis_cache` / `redis_queue` / `redis_socketio` config entries)."
msgstr ""

# 페이로드에서 출발 할 수 없습니다 : 포크 PR의 실행은 빈을 수행 `pull_requests` 배열, 동일 `head_branch`
# 그리고 같은 `head_sha`. 도움자는 그러므로 요구합니다 API 다른 열린 풀 요청은 머리가 공유하고, 분기 matcher를
# 떨어뜨리며, 아무도 취소하지 않는 것은 잘못된 풀 요청을 취소합니다. 그 자체가 일치하지 않는 경우, 실패한 조회는 공유 머리보다 훨씬
# 더 가능성이.
msgid "Two open pull requests that share a head repository *and* a head branch, to different bases, cannot be told apart from the run payload: the runs of a fork PR carry an empty `pull_requests` array, the same `head_branch` and the same `head_sha`. The helper therefore asks the API whether any other open pull request shares that head, and drops the branch matcher while one does — cancelling nothing beats cancelling the wrong pull request. If that lookup itself fails the matcher stays on, because a failed lookup is far more likely than a shared head."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two or more terms MUST fail with `AnsibleError`."
msgstr "두 개 이상의 용어 MUST 실패 `AnsibleError`·."

# 카탈로그되기 때문에 입증되어야 합니다. `supports_vision` 아무 비전도 없다, 그리고 경로는 단지 요청이 이미지를 운반 할
# 때. · **공급 업체** 명백한 증거에 행동, 때문에 침묵은 그것을 위해 규범이다: 256 이름 * 1595 관련 항목
# `supports_system_messages` 모든 로컬 태그는 카탈로그가 아닙니다. 따라서 denial로 침묵을 읽는 것은 거의 모든
# 루트를 떨어질 것입니다. 모델은 카탈로그가 아닌 차일 때만 제외됩니다. `mode`, denies 시스템 메시지 outright, 또는
# 제공 `deprecation_date` 이미 과거.
# silently wrong. A capability the request **demands** must be proven, because
# such a flag is catalogued wherever it exists: an absent `supports_vision`
# means no vision, and the route is dropped only when the request carries an
# image. A **disqualifier** acts on explicit evidence only, because silence is
# the norm for it: 256 of 1595 entries carry `supports_system_messages` at all
# and a local tag is catalogued not at all, so reading silence as denial would
# drop nearly every route. A model is therefore excluded only when the catalog
# states a non-chat `mode`, denies system messages outright, or gives a
# `deprecation_date` already past.
msgid "Two polarities govern them, and mixing them up routes silently wrong. A capability the request **demands** must be proven, because such a flag is catalogued wherever it exists: an absent `supports_vision` means no vision, and the route is dropped only when the request carries an image. A **disqualifier** acts on explicit evidence only, because silence is the norm for it: 256 of 1595 entries carry `supports_system_messages` at all and a local tag is catalogued not at all, so reading silence as denial would drop nearly every route. A model is therefore excluded only when the catalog states a non-chat `mode`, denies system messages outright, or gives a `deprecation_date` already past."
msgstr ""

