msgid "[`files/test/test.sh`](files/test/test.sh) sends through every declared alias, catch-all and forward, and waits until each destination inside the mail domain holds its copy. The forwards, those of the users included, are sent through only in the rounds that deploy Stalwart as a primary app. A transport error while sending or polling counts as not yet, within the same poll budget. An alias destination outside it counts once Stalwart queued the copy or the bounce naming it and the subject reaches the sender, which proves Stalwart expanded the alias and attempted the delivery. A forward destination outside it counts once the account's active Sieve script redirects a copy to it, because Stalwart sends no bounce for a message a Sieve script generated. Matrix **variant 1** declares one of each."
msgstr ""

