msgid "``applications.web-app-erpnext.services.erpnext.api_bot.extra_roles`` lists the ERPNext roles the consumers need on ``erpnext-api-bot`` and defaults to an empty list. Every deploy grants them beside ``System Manager`` and the ``Script Manager`` of the Server Scripts switch; removing a role from the list does not revoke it. A listed role the site does not hold yet is created as an empty Role (``CHANGED created role <role>``) and granted in the same run; its consumer adds the permissions later. This role is the only writer of the bot’s roles, API key and API secret, so a consumer declares the roles it needs here instead of setting them itself."
