msgstr "`tasks/01_init.yml`:: **per-consumer 제공** (ACL 사용자 / vhost / 네임스페이스 및 그 자격 증명), idempotent, 미러링 postgres `01_init`·."

# `HiddenServiceDir` (소유자 = in-container tor UID, `0700` 뚱 베어 `0600` 이름 *) Tor
# 컨테이너가 시작되기 전에. 에 디스크 키는 결코 overwritten.
# into the volume-backed `HiddenServiceDir` (owner = in-container tor UID,
# `0700` dir, `0600` secret) before the Tor container starts. Existing on-disk
# keys are never overwritten.
msgid "`tasks/01_restore_key.yml` writes the vaulted files into the volume-backed `HiddenServiceDir` (owner = in-container tor UID, `0700` dir, `0600` secret) before the Tor container starts. Existing on-disk keys are never overwritten."
