# `app/i18n/content/<code>.yaml`, 영어 소스 문자열에서 키에 대한 번역에 평면 매핑 `description`·
# `info`· `name`· `subtitel`· `text`· `title` 이름 * `warning`·
# [web-app-dashboard](../../roles/web-app-dashboard/meta/volumes.yml) 마운트만
# `config.yaml`, 그리고 업스트림 이미지는 카탈로그를 발송하지 않습니다, 그래서 모든 카드와 메뉴 텍스트는 역할을 구축 할
# 때까지 영어를 체재.
# `app/i18n/content/<code>.yaml`, a flat mapping from the English source
# string to its translation for the keys `description`, `info`, `name`,
# `subtitel`, `text`, `title` and `warning`.
# [web-app-dashboard](../../roles/web-app-dashboard/meta/volumes.yml) mounts
# only `config.yaml`, and the upstream image ships no catalog, so every card
# and menu text stays English until the role builds them in.
msgid "port-ui translates the rendered `config.yaml` through `app/i18n/content/<code>.yaml`, a flat mapping from the English source string to its translation for the keys `description`, `info`, `name`, `subtitel`, `text`, `title` and `warning`. [web-app-dashboard](../../roles/web-app-dashboard/meta/volumes.yml) mounts only `config.yaml`, and the upstream image ships no catalog, so every card and menu text stays English until the role builds them in."
msgstr ""

