msgid "the ``role#variant`` token to resume at, or ``''`` when the source run started at the head and got nothing skippable of this line green -- then the retrigger starts at the head too, as it would without an offset."
msgstr ""

# 이 선 녹색의 건너뛰지 않는 것을 얻은 때 -- 그 후에 retrigger는 맨 위에, 그것을 상쇄 없이 시작할 것입니다. 반환된 토큰은
# 순위에서 자리를 차지하므로 axes를 운반하고, 그 뒤에 회원 테스트를 수행하지 않습니다. (:func:`proven_rows`):
# 소스는 자체 스윕 번호 아래 조합을 기록하고 리 트리거는 신선한 것을 얻으므로 행에 따라 행을 비교하면 회전을 생존하는 유일한
# 비교입니다.
# when the source run started at the head and got nothing skippable of this
# line green -- then the retrigger starts at the head too, as it would without
# an offset.  The returned token names a place in the ranking, so it carries
# no axes, and neither does the membership test behind it
# (:func:`proven_rows`): the source run recorded its combinations under its
# own sweep number and the retrigger gets a fresh one, so comparing them row
# by row is the only comparison that survives the rotation.
msgid "the ``role#variant`` token to resume at, or ``''`` when the source run started at the head and got nothing skippable of this line green -- then the retrigger starts at the head too, as it would without an offset.  The returned token names a place in the ranking, so it carries no axes, and neither does the membership test behind it (:func:`proven_rows`): the source run recorded its combinations under its own sweep number and the retrigger gets a fresh one, so comparing them row by row is the only comparison that survives the rotation."
msgstr ""

