# 더 보기 `github.ref` 이름 * *기본 정보* 분기 등 `github.ref_name` 말 그대로 `main` 그리고 규칙은
# 일정하게 붕괴 `false` — 모든 잡아당기기 요구는 그것의 predecessor를 취소할 것입니다.
# `entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml` 그러므로 선언 `cancel-in-progress: true` 자세히 보기.
# listens on `pull_request_target`.** There `github.ref` is the *base* branch,
# so `github.ref_name` is literally `main` and the rule collapses to a
# constant `false` — every pull request would stop cancelling its predecessor.
# `entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml` therefore declares `cancel-in-progress:
# true` outright.
msgid "⚠️ **Do not paste that expression into a workflow that listens on `pull_request_target`.** There `github.ref` is the *base* branch, so `github.ref_name` is literally `main` and the rule collapses to a constant `false` — every pull request would stop cancelling its predecessor. `entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml` therefore declares `cancel-in-progress: true` outright."
msgstr ""

# `main` 이름 * **힘 PUshed** 소스 저장소의 `main`. 포크에서만 존재하는 모든 커밋 `main` 이름 * **경고없이
# 표제** 다음의 푸시에 어떤 커버 지점. 직접 작업 또는 합병 `main` 동기화 된 저장소에. 항상 일 `feature/**`·
# `fix/**`, 또는 `hotfix/**` 분지; 치료 `main` 소스의 읽기 전용 거울로. 자주 묻는 질문 `main` 작업
# 지점으로 먼저 동기화할 수 있습니다. (이름 ***sync를 비활성화하려면** 이름 *)·.
# the sync runs, the current repository's `main` is **force-pushed** from the
# source repository's `main`. Any commit that exists only on the fork's `main`
# is **discarded without warning** on the next push to any covered branch.
# Never commit or merge work directly into `main` on a synced repository.
# Always work on a `feature/**`, `fix/**`, or `hotfix/**` branch; treat `main`
# as a read-only mirror of the source. If you must use `main` as a working
# branch, disable the sync first (see**To disable the sync** below).
msgid "⚠️ **Forced overwrite — do not work in `main`.** When the sync runs, the current repository's `main` is **force-pushed** from the source repository's `main`. Any commit that exists only on the fork's `main` is **discarded without warning** on the next push to any covered branch. Never commit or merge work directly into `main` on a synced repository. Always work on a `feature/**`, `fix/**`, or `hotfix/**` branch; treat `main` as a read-only mirror of the source. If you must use `main` as a working branch, disable the sync first (see **To disable the sync** below)."
msgstr ""

